[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 53 An interesting climate",
    "start": 1.551,
    "end": 5.852,
    "zh": "第53课 有趣的气候",
    "zh_hant": "第53課 有趣的氣候"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 7.393,
    "end": 11.295,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "What is the favourite subject of conversation",
    "start": 12.876,
    "end": 16.558,
    "zh": "人们最喜欢谈论的话题是什么",
    "zh_hant": "人們最喜歡談論的話題是什麼"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "in England?",
    "start": 16.378,
    "end": 17.698,
    "zh": "在英国？",
    "zh_hant": "在英國？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Where do you come from?",
    "start": 20.88,
    "end": 22.501,
    "zh": "你来自哪里？",
    "zh_hant": "你來自哪裡？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "I come from England.",
    "start": 23.942,
    "end": 25.982,
    "zh": "我来自英国。",
    "zh_hant": "我來自英國。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "What's the climate like in your country?",
    "start": 27.723,
    "end": 30.685,
    "zh": "你们国家的气候怎么样？",
    "zh_hant": "你們國家的氣候怎麼樣？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "It's mild, but it's not always pleasant.",
    "start": 31.985,
    "end": 35.627,
    "zh": "气候温和，但并非总是宜人。",
    "zh_hant": "氣候溫和，但並非總是宜人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "The weather's often cold in the North",
    "start": 36.628,
    "end": 39.669,
    "zh": "北方天气常常寒冷",
    "zh_hant": "北方天氣常常寒冷"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "and windy in the East.",
    "start": 39.969,
    "end": 41.911,
    "zh": "东方则多风。",
    "zh_hant": "東方則多風。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "It's often wet in the West",
    "start": 42.471,
    "end": 44.872,
    "zh": "西方常常潮湿",
    "zh_hant": "西方常常潮溼"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "and sometimes warm in the South.",
    "start": 44.972,
    "end": 47.693,
    "zh": "南方有时温暖。",
    "zh_hant": "南方有時溫暖。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Which seasons do you like best?",
    "start": 49.455,
    "end": 52.336,
    "zh": "你最喜欢哪个季节？",
    "zh_hant": "你最喜歡哪個季節？"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "I like spring and summer.",
    "start": 53.757,
    "end": 56.078,
    "zh": "我喜欢春天和夏天。",
    "zh_hant": "我喜歡春天和夏天。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "The days are long and the nights are short.",
    "start": 56.518,
    "end": 60.16,
    "zh": "白天长，夜晚短。",
    "zh_hant": "白天長，夜晚短。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "The sun rises early and sets late.",
    "start": 60.62,
    "end": 64.422,
    "zh": "太阳升得早，落得晚。",
    "zh_hant": "太陽昇得早，落得晚。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "I don't like autumn and winter.",
    "start": 65.743,
    "end": 68.464,
    "zh": "我不喜欢秋天和冬天。",
    "zh_hant": "我不喜歡秋天和冬天。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "The days are short and the nights are long.",
    "start": 69.004,
    "end": 72.926,
    "zh": "白天短，夜晚长。",
    "zh_hant": "白天短，夜晚長。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "The sun rises late and sets early.",
    "start": 73.667,
    "end": 77.208,
    "zh": "太阳升得晚，落得早。",
    "zh_hant": "太陽昇得晚，落得早。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Our climate is not very good,",
    "start": 78.069,
    "end": 80.81,
    "zh": "我们的气候不是很好，",
    "zh_hant": "我們的氣候不是很好，"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "but it's certainly interesting.",
    "start": 81.034,
    "end": 83.58,
    "zh": "但确实很有趣。",
    "zh_hant": "但確實很有趣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "It's our favourite subject of conversation.",
    "start": 84.042,
    "end": 87.17,
    "zh": "这是我们最喜欢谈论的话题。",
    "zh_hant": "這是我們最喜歡談論的話題。"
  }
]
